tests:
  unit: { count: 69, covers: "one version across the workspace, tauri.conf and ui/package.json with an MSI-valid numeric pre-release (the tree ships 0.1.0-1), the package plan per OS and stage (only build stages install, the sign argv names no pnpm, updater artifacts exactly with the key), the smoke's installer pick, argv and ready line, the release manifest's 18 target keys, signatures and notes, the updater's throttle, offer and refusal texts, staging and the held exit while a failed install is told, the login item's program at login ($APPIMAGE only inside its $APPDIR) and no SMAppService below macOS 13" }
