  e2e: { count: 3, covers: "the real cargo xtask package (package-test profile, --features package-tests, macOS): a release-flavoured bundle after an e2e build, codesign --verify --deep --strict, the login agent in the .app and the updater archive, cargo xtask smoke capturing through the installed core headless, then the .dmg installed into a temp folder opening its window whose own core captures through the proxy, mints its CA under a temp HOME, and frees both fixed ports with no process left when the app ends (J1, J4). J2/J3 (a real signed update) are the rc-to-rc hand check; the update mechanism is the integration suite's" }
